  "Line": {
    "DefaultText": "And freedom you will have.\n\n\nYour masters have been exorcised and devoured.\n\n\nEvery spirit that enters your soul from now on, shall be aligned to your will.\n\n\nBe no longer a slave to your beliefs, be now their master.",
    "Text": "你将拥有自由。\\n\\n\\n你的主人已被驱逐和吞噬。\\n\\n\\n从现在开始，进入你灵魂的每一个精魄，都将与你的意志一致。\\n\\n\\n不再是信仰的奴隶，而是它们的主人。",
    "zh": "你将拥有自由。\\n\\n\\n你的主人已被驱逐和吞噬。\\n\\n\\n从现在开始，进入你灵魂的每一个精魄，都将与你的意志一致。\\n\\n\\n不再是信仰的奴隶，而是它们的主人。",
    "en": "And freedom you will have.\\n\\n\\nYour masters have been exorcised and devoured.\\n\\n\\nEvery spirit that enters your soul from now on, shall be aligned to your will.\\n\\n\\nBe no longer a slave to your beliefs, be now their master.",
